{2}╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮{R}
{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Stop a otter managed running container environment {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter stop my-box                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter stop --all                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter stop --yes my-box                            {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}  ┆ {4}-a{R}  Stop all otters                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R} ┆ {4}-r{R}  stop rootful containers                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--yes{R}  ┆ {4}-Y{R}  Stop without confirmation              {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    ┆ {4}-h{R}  Show this help message              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--verbose{R} ┆ {4}-v{R}  Show more verbose output            {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}  Prefer over 'sudo otter'.If you dont want   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         to use 'sudo' for root escalation you can   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         Set OTR_SUDO_PROGRAM to use different app.  {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} Rootful containers need '--root' for 'stop' to work.{2}│{R}
{2}╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯{R}
